{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:298","content":{"id":298,"title":"审视自己和信息的关系","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"444fd795-f3de-48be-9b3e-d2fe1dde3d15","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"是你掌控信息，还是信息掌控你，我们现在看到信息就像是看到食物一样，不可抑制的被信息吸引，特别是小红书，抖音，止不住的往下刷，信息成瘾，需要化被动为主动，不要被信息给掌控。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c448408c-5089-4f35-9317-6e8042c585c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"信息成瘾追求的不是信息的质量，而是获取信息的这个过程。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cb98ef73-b69e-451f-befd-967e00c055dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"信息茧房，只看得到和我观点类似的信息，无论是因为推荐算法还是个人偏见。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"收集篇，如何做筛选，获取高质量信息","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:297","type":"doc","id":297}},{"label":"审视自己和信息的关系","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:298","type":"doc","id":298}}],"prevPage":{"title":"收集篇，如何做筛选，获取高质量信息","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:297","type":"doc","id":297}},"nextPage":{"title":"原则","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:299","type":"doc","id":299}},"createTime":1743909607220,"updateTime":1743909822300,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743909822300}}